@startuml UC-49
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-49.md
title UC-49: Set Featured
footer Feature APRD-05 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-15
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/ProductsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProductService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Staff, Admin

U -> MVC : Toggle "Featured" on a product
MVC -> API : PATCH /api/admin/products/{id}/featured { isFeatured }
API -> SVC : SetFeaturedAsync(id, isFeatured)
SVC -> DB : Find product
alt not found
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Show "Not found"
else found
  SVC -> DB : Set IsFeatured\nSaveChangesAsync
note right of SVC : Shown in Featured Products (UC-19, BR-15)
  SVC --> API : OK
  API --> MVC : 204 No Content
  MVC --> U : Show updated state
end

@enduml
